# Application settings and credentials belong in config.json.
# See docs/gateway-auth.example.json and docs/gateway-auth.md.
# Host selector; relative paths resolve against the process working directory.
# GATEWAY_CONFIG_FILE=/absolute/path/config.json
# Compose deployment parameters (not application overrides):
# PLATFORM_GATEWAY_CONFIG_HOST_FILE=./config.json
# PLATFORM_GATEWAY_LOG_HOST_DIR=./logs
# PLATFORM_GATEWAY_HOST_PORT=8091
# PLATFORM_GATEWAY_CONTAINER_PORT=8091
# PLATFORM_GATEWAY_TAG=1.0.0
# External environment remains supported, e.g. HTTP_PROXY/HTTPS_PROXY/NO_PROXY
# and SSL_CERT_FILE. Jira bypasses proxies; CKLogs uses runtime proxy settings.
